{"id":"veneno","lemma":"veneno","pos":"noun","rank":1700,"glosses":["poison (substance that is harmful or lethal to a living organism)","venom (poison carried by an animal)"],"ipa":"/beˈneno/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"venenos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/57/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-veneno.wav","examples":[{"text":"El veneno te puede matar.","en":"Poison can kill you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450331","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to kill, slay"}]},{"text":"¿El azúcar es un veneno?","en":"Is sugar a poison?","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"sugar"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Él tomó veneno por error.","en":"He took poison by mistake.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to take","l":"tomar"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"error"}]},{"text":"Ella se suicidó tomando veneno.","en":"She killed herself by taking poison.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/768059","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to commit suicide","l":"suicidar"},{"g":"to take","l":"tomar"},null]},{"text":"El veneno se extendió por todo su cuerpo.","en":"The poison spread through his whole body.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831163","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to extend, to expand","l":"extender"},null,null,{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"body"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"in total"]]}]}